# Screenshot tooling. The harness (capture.cjs) is worth keeping; its browser
# profile, node_modules, captures and logs are throwaway artifacts.
#
# These patterns must match the CURRENT location. The harness moved under
# RESEARCH TRASH/, and the old root-anchored patterns silently stopped
# matching - which is how a 135MB browser profile ended up staged and
# deployable. Artifact paths move; ignore rules have to move with them.
tmp-shot/
**/tmp-shot/
**/edge-profile/
**/edge-profile-*/
**/shots/

.dead-css-map.json